    description: "Behind the shield sits a secret code of colored pegs, and you have ten guesses to crack it. Code Breaker is the Mastermind duel in its purest form: each guess earns you black pegs for the right color in the right place, and white pegs for the right color in the wrong place — nothing more. From that thin stream of clues, logic must do the rest: eliminate colors, pin positions, and converge on the code before your rows run out. It's a complete course in deductive reasoning disguised as a board game, and the moment a guess returns four blacks is one of gaming's quietest triumphs.",
